# The privacy policy draft is deliberately NOT committed.
#
# GitHub Pages requires this repo to be public, so anything committed here is
# world-readable the moment it lands — including on a side branch. An unapproved
# privacy policy published under an MGH-LCS URL reads as an official Mass General
# Brigham representation, which is exactly what the legal review is for.
#
# The draft therefore lives only on the author's machine until sign-off.
# See README.md § "Publishing the privacy policy" for the promotion steps.
